                {id: 21, type: 'single', content: '在一个单链表中P所指结点后插入一个S所指结点时，应执行语句： 。', options: '["A. P->next=S;S->next=P->next;", "B. S->next=P->next;P->next=S;", "C. S->next=P->next;P=S;", "D. S->next=P;P->next=S;"]', answer: 'B', analysis: '【所属章节：第5讲 单链表的基本运算】', knowledgePointId: '6320775'},
